  /// The bounding boxes match metrics for each intersection-over-union threshold 0.05,0.10,...,0.95,0.96,0.97,0.98,0.99 and each label confidence threshold 0.05,0.10,...,0.95,0.96,0.97,0.98,0.99 pair.
